Quality bar: Every decision and every commitment in the notes file is in the memo, and nothing is in the memo that the notes do not say.
Scope: One memo per request, from the one notes file the requester names: the decisions made in that meeting and the action items (every commitment someone made, labelled ACTION or said in passing). Nothing from other meetings and no recap of the discussion.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-e5-s3-1792814736/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
Reports to: lead

